    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "have-you-heard",
        "title": "Have you heard?",
        "body": [
          "**Owulidde amawulire?** kiba **Have you heard the news?** Okuddamu: **Yes, I heard it on the radio.** (**hear → heard**)."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "says-that",
        "title": "He says that …",
        "body": [
          "**Agamba nti** kiba **he says that**: **He says that rain is coming.** **They say that the new road is finished.** Abantu batera okuleka **that**: **They say the road is finished.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i-think",
        "title": "Endowooza",
        "body": [
          "**I think that it is good.** **I agree with you.** **I don’t agree.** Okubuuza endowooza: **What is your opinion?** oba **What do you think?**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Leediyo",
        "body": [
          "Mu Uganda abantu bangi bawulira amawulire ku leediyo era bakubira essimu ku pulogulaamu. Mu Lungereza: **a talk show**, **a caller**, **the presenter**."
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
